[background arg="res://backgrounds/meadow.webp" fade="1.0"]
# Everyone has been introduced by now, so all name boxes show real names.
set {elion_name} = "Elion"
set {theo_name} = "Theo"
set {cassia_name} = "Cassia"

narrator: Remi finished his performance with one final step before taking a proud bow. #id:11
narrator: Elion and Theo looked pleased, but Cassia remained completely silent, her arms still folded. #id:12
narrator: For a few long seconds, no one could tell what she was thinking. #id:13

join remi (Happy) left
remi (Confused): ...Squeak? #id:14
join Theo (Default) leftmost
Theo (Shocked): (Oh no... Is that good or bad?) #id:15
join elion (Default) right
elion (Smile): Another magnificent performance, Sir Remi! #id:16
Theo (Crashout): (Ah! Elion, please... at least try to read the room!) #id:17
join cassia (Default) rightmost
cassia (Default): … #id:18
cassia (Surprised): Hmph. #id:19
cassia: You're better than I expected. #id:1a
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:1b
cassia (Default): Don't look so proud. I said you were good, not perfect. #id:1c
Theo (Thinking): (Uhh… That means she … accepts Mr. Remi? That's probably the nicest thing we're going to get out of her, I think…) #id:1d
elion (Default): Then, Lady Cassia... does this mean you will join us? #id:1e
cassia (Disapproved): You really are not going to let this go, are you? #id:1f
cassia (Default): Fine. I'll join your team. #id:20
remi (Please): Squeak! Squeak!! #id:21
elion (Smile): Wonderful! Then our group is finally complete! #id:22
Theo (Default): Somehow... we actually did it. #id:23
cassia (Disapproved): Save the excitement for when we actually win. #id:24
elion (Determined): Of course! Then let us make sure we do! #id:25
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:26

narrator: And just like that, Remi had finally found all three companions he needed. #id:27
narrator: Elion, the kind-hearted paladin. #id:28
narrator: Theo, the thoughtful mage. #id:29
narrator: And Cassia, the fierce rogue who was definitely not going to admit she enjoyed Remi's performance. #id:2a

cassia (Default): Enough wasting time. If we're going, then move. #id:2b
elion (Smile): She is right! We should make our way to the festival at once! #id:2c
Theo (Smile): Uh-huh…! #id:2d
remi: Squeak! #id:2e

narrator: With his new team gathered at last, Remi set off toward the festival. #id:2f
narrator: The dancing contest, and perhaps the beginning of something much greater, was waiting for them. #id:30
narrator: And so, their journey to the stage began. #id:31